      "writtenOn": "2024-04-29T17:48:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if there would be concerns about just setting but not using `SG_DMA_SWIOTLB` in the direct DMA path. This flag is set and used in the dma-iommu path for the sync operations. Do you think we should do something similar in the direct DMA path?",
      "parentUuid": "4f35fb25_86291b10",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 72,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "4575c060464b2b8e7d236daaff296482543e3d41",
